TITLE 1D transport: Na/Ca exchange

SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -time_step 1
    -print_cells 4
    -print_frequency 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings shift NaX_ex4
10 PUNCH SIM_NO, MOL("NaX")

END
